ge.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WRrGYalXXveItfpnipYdayFkQB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"To take down South Boston's Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there's a mole among them.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11423,\"title\":\"Memories of Murder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":146233,\"title\":\"Prisoners\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uhviyknTT5cEQXbn6vWIqfM4vGm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3RFmTz5h2UuFWEV4oH00XICBR9y.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his six-year-old daughter is abducted, a desperate father takes justice into his own hands when he loses faith in the detective leading the investigation, setting both men on a collision course as the search descends into obsession and moral compromise.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":242582,\"title\":\"Nightcrawler\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j9HrX8f7GbZQm1BrBiR40uFQZSb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCnpRvVBqltC8ZuVP67C4fdUCb4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Lou Bloom, desperate for work, muscles into the world of L.A. crime journalism, he blurs the line between observer and participant to become the star of his own story. Aiding him in his effort is Nina, a TV-news veteran.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1359,\"title\":\"American Psycho\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9uGHEgsiUXjCNq8wdq4r49YL8A1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5oaMV2q0qzxkIW2ukU3lldLu5q2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A wealthy New York investment banking executive hides his alternate psychopathic ego from his co-workers and friends as he escalates deeper into his illogical, gratuitous fantasies.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1492640,\"title\":\"UNABOMBER\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/39aMkR8Y5vhCG9dTkjiqRl8AVqp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/XohTvvPXiGhUKhiQSvmoMTnj2z.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follow Ted Kaczynski's transformation from Harvard prodigy into the infamous Unabomber. Subjected to controversial psychological experiments by Professor Henry Murray, Kaczynski's troubled past resurfaces decades later when his manhunt, led by FBI agent Joanne Miller, brings to light the chilling consequences of ambition and isolation.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860508,\"title\":\"The Whisper Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ndRs5lADYm0PeVjuOxaMcInY0o2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uauoVKKCkNA9iWjgJCL8TdSfLf5.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When his young son vanishes, a widower enlists help from his estranged father, a retired detective who put away the serial killer now linked to the case.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":